  "story_en": "As the afternoon light softens, the young man asks Paul how he found such peace. Paul smiles warmly, recognizing the open door to give his personal testimony.\n\n“Years ago, my life felt empty and directionless,” Paul begins honestly. “I carried guilt and wounded relationships. But when I experienced God’s unconditional forgiveness, everything changed from the inside out.”\n\nHe explains how this spiritual encounter brought deep inner transformation. Old habits lost their power, and God’s grace began a complete restoration of his heart. Instead of chasing temporary success, he discovered a clear divine purpose for his future.\n\n“My life is now a living witness of His mercy,” Paul concludes with genuine conviction. The young man listens intently, realizing that the same healing and renewal are possible in his own life.",
